WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:06.469
Connect two cards to say which work comes first. The arrow points from the prerequisite to the card that depends on it.

00:00:07.422 --> 00:00:13.924
Starting the dependent card puts it in the queue, even if the first card has not been started yet. Its card says what it is waiting for.

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:21.028
You can still start it early. Obeya asks you to confirm, naming the unfinished prerequisite, before starting the card.
